		'Verified affected host/replay/terminal/web behavior tests and isolated browser rendering at 390, 768 and 1280 CSS pixels. A complete DevTools Enter key event includes text carriage-return; omitting text did not trigger native button activation and was a harness error, not a UI failure. String true/false values preserve aria-expanded. Native raw-details button supports keyboard activation. No provider calls were used. Presentation output slices avoid another copy of diff text; closed cards and collapsed raw details do not render their full content.'
